{"id": "eury_ELET_System-level_in_ELET_Indicator_3", "filename": "eury_ELET_System-level_in_ELET_Indicator_3.csv", "data": [{"System-level indicators for monitoring education and training systems in Europe – 2025": "System-level indicators on early leaving from education and training (ELET)", "Unnamed: 1": "", "Unnamed: 2": "", "Unnamed: 3": "", "Unnamed: 4": "", "Unnamed: 5": "", "Unnamed: 6": "", "Unnamed: 7": "", "Unnamed: 8": "", "Unnamed: 9": "", "Unnamed: 10": "", "Unnamed: 11": "", "Unnamed: 12": "", "Unnamed: 13": "", "Unnamed: 14": "", "Unnamed: 15": "", "Unnamed: 16": "", "Unnamed: 17": "", "Unnamed: 18": "", "Unnamed: 19": "", "Unnamed: 20": "", "Unnamed: 22": ""}, {"System-level indicators for monitoring education and training systems in Europe – 2025": "Indicator 3: Teacher competences related to ELET promoted through top-level competence frameworks for ITE and/or top-level CPD programmes, ISCED 1-34, 2024/2025", "Unnamed: 1": "", "Unnamed: 2": "", "Unnamed: 3": "", "Unnamed: 4": "", "Unnamed: 5": "", "Unnamed: 6": "", "Unnamed: 7": "", "Unnamed: 8": "", "Unnamed: 9": "", "Unnamed: 10": "", "Unnamed: 11": "", "Unnamed: 12": "", "Unnamed: 13": "", "Unnamed: 14": "", "Unnamed: 15": "", "Unnamed: 16": "", "Unnamed: 17": "", "Unnamed: 18": "", "Unnamed: 19": "", "Unnamed: 20": "", "Unnamed: 22": ""}, {"System-level indicators for monitoring education and training systems in Europe – 2025": "", "Unnamed: 1": "Diagnosing ELET risk factors (e.g. learning difficulties, truancy, illness, peer-influence or teacher-student-relationships)", "Unnamed: 2": "", "Unnamed: 3": "Developing effective interventions to prevent ELET", "Unnamed: 4": "", "Unnamed: 5": "Promoting a positive school climate (e.g. through class management, conflict resolution, relationship building, and bullying and violence prevention)", "Unnamed: 6": "", "Unnamed: 7": "Teaching diverse learners and promoting inclusive approaches (e.g. through avoiding stereotyping, prejudice, and other forms of discrimination)", "Unnamed: 8": "", "Unnamed: 9": "Teaching in multilingual and multicultural settings", "Unnamed: 10": "", "Unnamed: 11": "Awareness of learners' social and emotional development ", "Unnamed: 12": "", "Unnamed: 13": "Collaborating effectively with families from different backgrounds", "Unnamed: 14": "", "Unnamed: 15": "Managing their own (i.e. teachers’) well-being, mental health and stress", "Unnamed: 16": "", "Unnamed: 17": "Other", "Unnamed: 18": "", "Unnamed: 19": "No top-level competence framework for ITE ", "Unnamed: 20": "No relevant top-level CPD", "Unnamed: 22": ""}, {"System-level indicators for monitoring education and training systems in Europe – 2025": "", "Unnamed: 1": "ITE", "Unnamed: 2": "CPD", "Unnamed: 3": "ITE", "Unnamed: 4": "CPD", "Unnamed: 5": "ITE", "Unnamed: 6": "CPD", "Unnamed: 7": "ITE", "Unnamed: 8": "CPD", "Unnamed: 9": "ITE", "Unnamed: 10": "CPD", "Unnamed: 11": "ITE", "Unnamed: 12": "CPD", "Unnamed: 13": "ITE", "Unnamed: 14": "CPD", "Unnamed: 15": "ITE", "Unnamed: 16": "CPD", "Unnamed: 17": "ITE", "Unnamed: 18": "CPD", "Unnamed: 19": "", "Unnamed: 20": "", "Unnamed: 22": ""}, {"System-level indicators for monitoring education and training systems in Europe – 2025": "BEfr", "Unnamed: 1": "", "Unnamed: 2": "1", "Unnamed: 3": "", "Unnamed: 4": "1", "Unnamed: 5": "", "Unnamed: 6": "1", "Unnamed: 7": "1", "Unnamed: 8": "1", "Unnamed: 9": "", "Unnamed: 10": "1", "Unnamed: 11": "", "Unnamed: 12": "1", "Unnamed: 13": "", "Unnamed: 14": "1", "Unnamed: 15": "", "Unnamed: 16": "1", "Unnamed: 17": "", "Unnamed: 18": "", "Unnamed: 19": "", "Unnamed: 20": "", "Unnamed: 22": "Explanatory note:"}, {"System-level indicators for monitoring education and training systems in Europe – 2025": "BEde", "Unnamed: 1": "1", "Unnamed: 2": "", "Unnamed: 3": "", "Unnamed: 4": "", "Unnamed: 5": "1", "Unnamed: 6": "", "Unnamed: 7": "1", "Unnamed: 8": "", "Unnamed: 9": "1", "Unnamed: 10": "", "Unnamed: 11": "1", "Unnamed: 12": "", "Unnamed: 13": "1", "Unnamed: 14": "", "Unnamed: 15": "", "Unnamed: 16": "", "Unnamed: 17": "", "Unnamed: 18": "", "Unnamed: 19": "", "Unnamed: 20": "1", "Unnamed: 22": "A competence framework can be defined as a set of statements outlining what a teacher should know and be able to do. It typically describes the skills, knowledge, and competences required for effective teaching. The format, value, and recognition of such frameworks can vary between countries."}, {"System-level indicators for monitoring education and training systems in Europe – 2025": "BEnl", "Unnamed: 1": "", "Unnamed: 2": "", "Unnamed: 3": "", "Unnamed: 4": "", "Unnamed: 5": "1", "Unnamed: 6": "", "Unnamed: 7": "1", "Unnamed: 8": "", "Unnamed: 9": "1", "Unnamed: 10": "", "Unnamed: 11": "1", "Unnamed: 12": "", "Unnamed: 13": "1", "Unnamed: 14": "", "Unnamed: 15": "", "Unnamed: 16": "", "Unnamed: 17": "", "Unnamed: 18": "1", "Unnamed: 19": "", "Unnamed: 20": "", "Unnamed: 22": "Competence frameworks may inform the content of initial teacher education (ITE), which is designed to equip prospective teachers with core professional competences and to develop the attitudes essential for their future roles and responsibilities. ITE also  usually includes a first practical teaching experience through in-school placements."}, {"System-level indicators for monitoring education and training systems in Europe – 2025": "BG", "Unnamed: 1": "1", "Unnamed: 2": "1", "Unnamed: 3": "", "Unnamed: 4": "1", "Unnamed: 5": "1", "Unnamed: 6": "1", "Unnamed: 7": "1", "Unnamed: 8": "1", "Unnamed: 9": "1", "Unnamed: 10": "1", "Unnamed: 11": "1", "Unnamed: 12": "1", "Unnamed: 13": "1", "Unnamed: 14": "1", "Unnamed: 15": "", "Unnamed: 16": "1", "Unnamed: 17": "", "Unnamed: 18": "", "Unnamed: 19": "", "Unnamed: 20": "", "Unnamed: 22": "Continuing professional development (CPD) refers to the in-service training that teachers undertake throughout their careers to broaden, deepen, and update their knowledge, skills, and professional attitudes. It can take both formal and non-formal forms and may cover subject-specific content as well as pedagogical approaches."}, {"System-level indicators for monitoring education and training systems in Europe – 2025": "CZ", "Unnamed: 1": "1", "Unnamed: 2": "1", "Unnamed: 3": "1", "Unnamed: 4": "1", "Unnamed: 5": "1", "Unnamed: 6": "1", "Unnamed: 7": "1", "Unnamed: 8": "1", "Unnamed: 9": "1", "Unnamed: 10": "1", "Unnamed: 11": "1", "Unnamed: 12": "1", "Unnamed: 13": "1", "Unnamed: 14": "1", "Unnamed: 15": "1", "Unnamed: 16": "1", "Unnamed: 17": "", "Unnamed: 18": "", "Unnamed: 19": "", "Unnamed: 20": "", "Unnamed: 22": "A wide range of CPD formats is available, including courses, seminars, workshops, degree programmes, peer or self-observation and reflection, mentoring, participation in teacher networks, and observation visits. In some cases, CPD activities may lead to additional qualifications or certifications."}, {"System-level indicators for monitoring education and training systems in Europe – 2025": "DK", "Unnamed: 1": "1", "Unnamed: 2": "1", "Unnamed: 3": "", "Unnamed: 4": "", "Unnamed: 5": "1", "Unnamed: 6": "1", "Unnamed: 7": "1", "Unnamed: 8": "1", "Unnamed: 9": "1", "Unnamed: 10": "1", "Unnamed: 11": "1", "Unnamed: 12": "", "Unnamed: 13": "1", "Unnamed: 14": "1", "Unnamed: 15": "", "Unnamed: 16": "", "Unnamed: 17": "", "Unnamed: 18": "", "Unnamed: 19": "", "Unnamed: 20": "", "Unnamed: 22": "Country-specific notes:"}, {"System-level indicators for monitoring education and training systems in Europe – 2025": "DE", "Unnamed: 1": "1", "Unnamed: 2": "1", "Unnamed: 3": "1", "Unnamed: 4": "1", "Unnamed: 5": "1", "Unnamed: 6": "1", "Unnamed: 7": "1", "Unnamed: 8": "1", "Unnamed: 9": "1", "Unnamed: 10": "1", "Unnamed: 11": "1", "Unnamed: 12": "1", "Unnamed: 13": "1", "Unnamed: 14": "1", "Unnamed: 15": "1", "Unnamed: 16": "1", "Unnamed: 17": "", "Unnamed: 18": "", "Unnamed: 19": "", "Unnamed: 20": "", "Unnamed: 22": "Belgium (BE de): There are no ITE programmes for teachers of secondary schools."}, {"System-level indicators for monitoring education and training systems in Europe – 2025": "EE", "Unnamed: 1": "1", "Unnamed: 2": "1", "Unnamed: 3": "1", "Unnamed: 4": "1", "Unnamed: 5": "1", "Unnamed: 6": "1", "Unnamed: 7": "1", "Unnamed: 8": "1", "Unnamed: 9": "1", "Unnamed: 10": "1", "Unnamed: 11": "1", "Unnamed: 12": "1", "Unnamed: 13": "1", "Unnamed: 14": "1", "Unnamed: 15": "1", "Unnamed: 16": "1", "Unnamed: 17": "", "Unnamed: 18": "", "Unnamed: 19": "", "Unnamed: 20": "", "Unnamed: 22": "Belgium (BE nl): The category 'Other' refers to the fact that school teams independently tailor their CPD programmes to their learning needs without any mandated requirements from the Flemish government."}, {"System-level indicators for monitoring education and training systems in Europe – 2025": "IE", "Unnamed: 1": "", "Unnamed: 2": "1", "Unnamed: 3": "", "Unnamed: 4": "1", "Unnamed: 5": "1", "Unnamed: 6": "1", "Unnamed: 7": "1", "Unnamed: 8": "1", "Unnamed: 9": "1", "Unnamed: 10": "1", "Unnamed: 11": "", "Unnamed: 12": "1", "Unnamed: 13": "1", "Unnamed: 14": "1", "Unnamed: 15": "", "Unnamed: 16": "1", "Unnamed: 17": "", "Unnamed: 18": "", "Unnamed: 19": "", "Unnamed: 20": "", "Unnamed: 22": "Ireland: Data only apply to ISCED 1 and 24."}, {"System-level indicators for monitoring education and training systems in Europe – 2025": "EL", "Unnamed: 1": "", "Unnamed: 2": "1", "Unnamed: 3": "", "Unnamed: 4": "1", "Unnamed: 5": "", "Unnamed: 6": "1", "Unnamed: 7": "", "Unnamed: 8": "1", "Unnamed: 9": "", "Unnamed: 10": "1", "Unnamed: 11": "", "Unnamed: 12": "1", "Unnamed: 13": "", "Unnamed: 14": "1", "Unnamed: 15": "", "Unnamed: 16": "", "Unnamed: 17": "", "Unnamed: 18": "", "Unnamed: 19": "1", "Unnamed: 20": "", "Unnamed: 22": "Luxembourg: While there is no national competence framework for ITE, the Bachelor degree in educational sciences at the University of Luxembourg offers courses covering some of these competencies for future primary school teachers (ISCED 1)."}, {"System-level indicators for monitoring education and training systems in Europe – 2025": "ES", "Unnamed: 1": "1", "Unnamed: 2": "1", "Unnamed: 3": "", "Unnamed: 4": "1", "Unnamed: 5": "1", "Unnamed: 6": "1", "Unnamed: 7": "1", "Unnamed: 8": "1", "Unnamed: 9": "1", "Unnamed: 10": "1", "Unnamed: 11": "1", "Unnamed: 12": "1", "Unnamed: 13": "1", "Unnamed: 14": "1", "Unnamed: 15": "1", "Unnamed: 16": "1", "Unnamed: 17": "", "Unnamed: 18": "", "Unnamed: 19": "", "Unnamed: 20": "", "Unnamed: 22": "Austria: The category 'Other' refers to some additional competences areas that are being promoted, such as promoting gender equality, inclusive pedagogy or teaching effectiveness."}, {"System-level indicators for monitoring education and training systems in Europe – 2025": "FR", "Unnamed: 1": "1", "Unnamed: 2": "1", "Unnamed: 3": "1", "Unnamed: 4": "1", "Unnamed: 5": "1", "Unnamed: 6": "1", "Unnamed: 7": "1", "Unnamed: 8": "1", "Unnamed: 9": "1", "Unnamed: 10": "1", "Unnamed: 11": "1", "Unnamed: 12": "1", "Unnamed: 13": "1", "Unnamed: 14": "1", "Unnamed: 15": "1", "Unnamed: 16": "1", "Unnamed: 17": "", "Unnamed: 18": "", "Unnamed: 19": "", "Unnamed: 20": "", "Unnamed: 22": "Romania: The category 'Other' refers to teacher competences in using technology to facilitate the learning process."}, {"System-level indicators for monitoring education and training systems in Europe – 2025": "HR", "Unnamed: 1": "", "Unnamed: 2": "", "Unnamed: 3": "", "Unnamed: 4": "", "Unnamed: 5": "1", "Unnamed: 6": "1", "Unnamed: 7": "1", "Unnamed: 8": "1", "Unnamed: 9": "1", "Unnamed: 10": "1", "Unnamed: 11": "1", "Unnamed: 12": "1", "Unnamed: 13": "", "Unnamed: 14": "", "Unnamed: 15": "1", "Unnamed: 16": "1", "Unnamed: 17": "", "Unnamed: 18": "", "Unnamed: 19": "", "Unnamed: 20": "", "Unnamed: 22": "Liechtenstein: There is no ITE in Liechtenstein."}, {"System-level indicators for monitoring education and training systems in Europe – 2025": "IT", "Unnamed: 1": "1", "Unnamed: 2": "1", "Unnamed: 3